WEBVTT

00:04:29.108 --> 00:04:31.838
as counter-cultural rebels.

00:04:31.838 --> 00:04:34.324
Diogenes’ ideas 
have been adopted

00:04:34.324 --> 00:04:37.164
and reimagined 
over and over again.

00:04:37.164 --> 00:04:39.464
The original cynics 
might not have approved

00:04:39.464 --> 00:04:40.914
of these fresh takes:

00:04:40.914 --> 00:04:44.235
they believed 
that their values of rejecting custom

00:04:44.235 --> 00:04:48.603
and living closely with nature 
were the only true values.

00:04:48.603 --> 00:04:52.941
Whether or not you agree with that, 
or with any of the later incarnations,

00:04:52.941 --> 00:04:57.421
all have one thing in common: 
they questioned the status quo.

00:04:57.421 --> 00:05:00.206
And that’s an example 
we can still follow: